Scouts (8/8 ran):
* 2610.29790 (Gauss–Fourier conjecture for second-kind zeros; Theorem 0.4: a real multiple zero M of
  (p′/p)′ occurs iff at least 3 root loci of 1/p, including a conjugate non-real pair, meet at M): no
